{"uuid": "79b37916-c05d-4818-9d67-3b90e340926e", "variant": "base", "mode": "judged", "bead": "hv-umm2.457", "commit": "e7de6866f1246776eee0587a61dfc8711d45edbf", "as": "player", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "as=player, desktop and mobile (judged for the discard-X least X and in the D21 sample, first SHA-256 byte 0x18). From hand: the X picker opens at its least X of 1 with the decrement disabled, so 0 is never offered; stepping to 2 and confirming pays 2●, gains 2⍟ and sends the event to the void with no discard prompt. By Reclaim from the void (0● staged, three hand cards): the void pile offers the card, and the discard prompt reads 1 to 3 cards with exactly the hand as candidates and Submit disabled at 0/3; reload mid-prompt restores the same prompt id with nothing paid. Discarding two sets X=2: both cards reach the void with discarded events, the third stays in hand, no energy is spent, 2⍟ are gained and the reclaimed event is banished. The battle log reads the two discards, the play and 2 points gained; the persisted game log records the discardCost prompt and its answer by instance and card UUID, no name. __caps empty. The lab debug button sits over the prompt's Cancel on mobile (debug-only overlay, pre-existing).", "screens": ["embrace-hand-x-desktop.png", "embrace-hand-x-mobile.png", "embrace-discard-prompt-desktop.png", "embrace-discard-prompt-mobile.png", "embrace-discard-selected-desktop.png", "embrace-discard-selected-mobile.png", "embrace-reclaimed-desktop.png", "embrace-reclaimed-mobile.png", "embrace-reclaim-log-desktop.png", "embrace-reclaim-log-mobile.png"]}
{"uuid": "79b37916-c05d-4818-9d67-3b90e340926e", "variant": "base", "mode": "judged", "bead": "hv-umm2.457", "commit": "e7de6866f1246776eee0587a61dfc8711d45edbf", "as": "enemy", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "as=enemy, desktop and mobile: with the event in its void, two hand cards and 0● staged and a scripted play from the void, the AI reclaims Embrace the Infinite, discards one card (X=1, the least X), gains 1⍟ and the event is banished; the log reads the discard, the play and 1 point gained, the enemy hand stays face down, and __caps is empty.", "screens": ["embrace-enemy-settled-desktop.png", "embrace-enemy-settled-mobile.png", "embrace-enemy-log-desktop.png", "embrace-enemy-log-mobile.png"]}
